 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 11427,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"8425\" data-start=\"8382\">Documentation should include:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"8572\" data-start=\"8426\">\n\t<li data-end=\"8460\" data-start=\"8426\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8460\" data-start=\"8428\">Problem statement and objectives</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"8481\" data-start=\"8461\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8481\" data-start=\"8463\">Design methodology</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"8517\" data-start=\"8482\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8517\" data-start=\"8484\">Code structure and libraries used</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"8542\" data-start=\"8518\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8542\" data-start=\"8520\">Test cases and results</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"8572\" data-start=\"8543\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8572\" data-start=\"8545\">Challenges and future scope</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"8595\" data-start=\"8574\">Presentation ensures:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"8725\" data-start=\"8596\">\n\t<li data-end=\"8635\" data-start=\"8596\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8635\" data-start=\"8598\">Clear articulation of problem-solving</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"8683\" data-start=\"8636\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8683\" data-start=\"8638\">Code walkthroughs with UI screenshots or demo</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"8725\" data-start=\"8684\">\n\t<p data-end=\"8725\" data-start=\"8686\">Outcome analysis and performance review</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"8853\" data-start=\"8727\">This reflective process evaluates feasibility, encourages feedback, and prepares students for industry or research-level work.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
